    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主题：五一曼谷游</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>想进听友群的朋友可添加微信：hougongzuozuo</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们期待你的加入～</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>废太子 &nbsp;&nbsp;格格 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>南瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客分享三位小伙伴五一去曼谷游玩的经历，惊喜不断，刺激连连。为什么南瓜出发前担忧不断？废太子被认成了谁的粉丝？格格为什么被吓到尖叫？泰国最红的明星居然是他？一切的答案将在本期揭晓～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a>:出发前的突发事故影响了泰国之旅？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a>:虽口语不好，但流畅交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a>:这是坐在格格怀里的距离！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a>:泰国电影院模式原来是这样的啊～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4111">01:08:31</a>:关于泰国最火的明星的二三事。</span></p>]]></description>
